{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/00d200cc7e950e0cbf9f1175e705883c.avif?t=1764609966\" width=600 height=227 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re just a small-town guy with big pastry dreams \u2014 and this summer, Paris is your playground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/cff7c8e56d8e06f08a7418ceb2d1e542.poster.avif?t=1764609966\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/cff7c8e56d8e06f08a7418ceb2d1e542.webm?t=1764609966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/cff7c8e56d8e06f08a7418ceb2d1e542.mp4?t=1764609966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a baking apprentice in one of the city\u2019s most iconic patisseries, you\u2019ll whip up mouth-watering desserts, impress picky customers, and try to win the title of France\u2019s top pastry chef. But it's not just about sugar and flour...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/228161d135367612a448d53552831c75.avif?t=1764609966\" width=598 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/fb7dd586cab81dde9bcf140ffd9eba2a.poster.avif?t=1764609966\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/fb7dd586cab81dde9bcf140ffd9eba2a.webm?t=1764609966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/fb7dd586cab81dde9bcf140ffd9eba2a.mp4?t=1764609966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re living in a luxurious home owned by your wealthy (and very curious) distant relative, meeting gorgeous caf\u00e9 regulars, and making choices that unlock romantic, steamy, and sometimes hilarious stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/d7bc094b16b982daa0bbd7b74301197f.poster.avif?t=1764609966\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/d7bc094b16b982daa0bbd7b74301197f.webm?t=1764609966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/d7bc094b16b982daa0bbd7b74301197f.mp4?t=1764609966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a visual novel with a point-and-click twist, packed with flirty humor, summer vibes, and sweet adult content. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/9c1d03bf27ee68ad979a709314ec9e0c.avif?t=1764609966\" width=600 height=235 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Parisian Summer Vibes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the sunny streets, cozy caf\u00e9s, and secret corners of a romanticized, modern-day Paris.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf70 <strong>Dessert-Making Mini-Games</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix, bake, decorate \u2014 and impress! Your skills in the kitchen lead to more than just praise\u2026 they unlock deeper (and hotter) storylines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8b <strong>Branching Romance Paths</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet unique girls with distinct personalities and backgrounds. Choose who to bond with \u2014 or chase them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe1 <strong>Life at the Mansion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living with your wealthy cousin? Expect surprises. Clean the house, do chores, or get into a little \u201ctrouble\u201d after hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Play Your Way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on love, desserts, or both. Your choices unlock different scenes, routes, and endings. Discover every flavor of this naughty Parisian tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/4591e5d6f4c67d4f5e195dbad2160388.poster.avif?t=1764609966\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/4591e5d6f4c67d4f5e195dbad2160388.webm?t=1764609966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/4591e5d6f4c67d4f5e195dbad2160388.mp4?t=1764609966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Landlady","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3684690/8fba9f1d0b4032f5dd31ad3e143073e8df222891.jpg"},{"name":"Inspection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3684690/ee5e35d388a0c20ec9359c68cf5fab84cfb868cc.jpg"},{"name":"Dessert Preparations","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3684690/ca564144118c0b0ac171fabaa0b1296a50f14526.jpg"},{"name":"Sin to the Beat","path":"https:/