ress! Your skills in the kitchen lead to more than just praise\u2026 they unlock deeper (and hotter) storylines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8b <strong>Branching Romance Paths</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet unique girls with distinct personalities and backgrounds. Choose who to bond with \u2014 or chase them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe1 <strong>Life at the Mansion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living with your wealthy cousin? Expect surprises. Clean the house, do chores, or get into a little \u201ctrouble\u201d after hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Play Your Way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on love, desserts, or both. Your choices unlock different scenes, routes, and endings. Discover every flavor of this naughty Parisian tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/4591e5d6f4c67d4f5e195dbad2160388.poster.avif?t=1764609966\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/4591e5d6f4c67d4f5e195dbad2160388.webm?t=1764609966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/4591e5d6f4c67d4f5e195dbad2160388.mp4?t=1764609966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Juicy Peach Games \ud83c\udf51"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/832a3dc05680290ac52dd36bab12ed6d8542fe51/header.jpg?t=1764609966","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3684690/2014717569/0b708a7ade16dca4749ca8e837c35d19c